&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Community You Will Join&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AirCover Insurance Platform team builds the systems behind AirCover, which includes Host liability insurance, Experiences liability insurance and Host damage protection. We make it possible to launch and operate insurance products across global markets, and to learn quickly what increases the number of Hosts and guests who are protected. The team works with engineering, product, data science and legal partners across Airbnb&#x27;s hubs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What kind of Software Engineer are we looking for?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Engineer on the AirCover Insurance Platform, you will lead the design and evolution of the core subsystems that manage policies, coverage, enrollment and regional rules, and the experimentation capabilities that drive attach rate. At the staff level, you establish the technical vision, then deliver a solution that is flexible, always available, auditable and able to scale with the needs of the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Difference You Will Make&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the future-state architecture that lets us expand AirCover to new regions and products without rebuilding for each market, balancing short-term launch needs against long-term technical quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design of an experimentation framework for insurance offers, pricing and placement, with trustworthy measurement of attach rate and downstream outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead engineers inside and outside your team in building these solutions, and be the technical lead and owner of significant scope through ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage early with product managers, designers, data scientists and legal partners to shape requirements and steer teams toward the most efficient path to our goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the bar for technical quality from design, through code review, to production operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers, and be a player/coach who helps build the team and drives collaboration across multiple teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply emerging technology, including LLMs, where it improves automation and the experience for Hosts and guests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;This Senior Quality Lead will own the quality program for AirCover. AirCover is Airbnb&#x27;s host protection and property damage insurance product, handling claim reviews at global scale with direct financial exposure in every case.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;This function requires a quality leader who can operate rigorously in environments where the stakes of a wrong answer are high, the workflows are complex, and quality measurement must go beyond behavioral compliance to evaluate decision accuracy and defensibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership &amp;amp; Program Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and execute the quality strategy for AirCover, aligned to the evolving needs of the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the single accountable Quality leader for AirCover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and optimize operating models and frameworks that are COPC-aligned.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent quality in WBRs, MBRs, QBRs, and executive reviews; deliver a proactive narrative that surfaces emerging risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;JobPostPage-content ⚙ ⚙1opjj73&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;about-stripe&quot;&gt;About Stripe&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#x27;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;about-the-team&quot;&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AI team is focused on one of Stripe’s most strategic growth areas: enabling the monetization and scaling of AI-native and AI-enabled businesses. We’re in a unique position – partnering with the world’s most ambitious AI companies (the likes of OpenAI, Anthropic, NVIDIA, etc) building on the frontier of artificial intelligence -- across infrastructure, foundation models, agents, and applications -- to help them grow and commercialize globally using Stripe’s full financial stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of Stripe’s GTM / Sales organization, this team works closely with Product, Engineering, and Marketing to shape Stripe’s AI GTM strategy and ensure that the world’s leading AI companies -- from early-stage innovators to the largest public players -- choose Stripe as their monetization platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;what-youll-do&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with existing Stripe customers in the AI Industry to develop and execute long-term sales strategies to expand Stripe’s revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full sales cycle, from business case development, to deal structuring and negotiating, to close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop account plans and cross sell into your list of strategic AI customers, driving growth through expansion and new revenue streams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive deal strategy and commercial negotiations for large, complex renewals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships with executive stakeholders within your book of business, deeply understanding problems they are solving and helping drive to solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for account mapping and coordinating effective meetings with the appropriate external stakeholders expanding the customer relationship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and contribute to team projects to develop and refine our sales process and help shape the Stripe sales culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
